==Match==

===Summary===
Bayern Munich defender [[Dante (footballer)|Dante]] opened the scoring in the seventh minute; after [[Jérôme Boateng]] headed [[Xherdan Shaqiri]]'s corner into his path, he turned and shot past goalkeeper [[Khalid Askri]]. [[Thiago Alcântara|Thiago]] got the second for Bayern in the 22nd minute, when he shot right-footed into the far corner from the edge of the penalty area after a pull-back pass from the left from [[David Alaba]]. Bayern had the chance to add a third midway through the second half, but Shaqiri hit the crossbar from six yards before Thiago shot the rebound high and wide. Raja Casablanca almost got themselves back into the game late on, when [[Vianney Mabidé]] found himself onside only to shoot straight at [[Manuel Neuer]] in the Bayern goal, and captain [[Mouhcine Moutouali]] hit the rebound over the bar from just outside the goal area.<ref>{{cite news |title=Bayern Munich beat Raja Casablanca to win Club World Cup final |url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2013/dec/21/raja-casablanca-bayern-munich-club-world-cup |work=The Observer |publisher=Guardian News and Media |date=21 December 2013 |access-date=3 January 2014 }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=Bayern Munich 2-0 Raja Casablanca |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/0/football/25406403 |publisher=BBC Sport (British Broadcasting Corporation) |date=21 December 2013 |access-date=3 January 2014 }}</ref>

